<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sanmina cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sanmina cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley analyst Shelby Fleck on Wednesday cut his rating for Sanmina Corp to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were off 2-3/4 to 61-1/4 in mid-morning trade.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
